846 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 454 0 R
/E (NearBy also plays a vital role in empowering local shop owners by providing them with a digital platform to showcase their products, manage stock, process orders, and receive customer feedback. Without investing in complex infrastructure, small businesses can expand their reach and increase sales within their locality. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
847 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 454 0 R
/E (Inaddition, the system integrates delivery agents who are responsible for collecting and delivering orders efficiently. This creates flexible employment opportunities while ensuring fast and reliable deliveries. By combining customers, shops, and delivery agents into a single platform, NearBy promotes smarter local shopping, supports local businesses, and improves service efficiency through modern mobile and web technologies. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10 11]
>>
endobj
848 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 454 0 R
/E (The application allows customers to browse products from registered nearby shops, view shop locations, compare prices, and choose between home delivery or direct shop pickup. This flexibility helps users save time while meeting urgent product needs such as groceries, medicines, and household items. Real- time order tracking and secure payment options further enhance the overall user experience. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
